{"s":32,"v":[{"t":"Alif, Lām, Meem.","w":[["الٓمٓ","Alif Lam Meem","alif-lam-meem",""]]},{"t":"[This is] the revelation of the Book about which there is no doubt from the Lord of the worlds.","w":[["تَنزِيلُ","(The) revelation","tanzīlu",""],["ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","(of) the Book","l-kitābi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["كِتَـٰبِ",63]]],["لَا","(there is) no","lā",""],["رَيْبَ","doubt","rayba",""],["فِيهِ","about it","fīhi","",[["فِي",14],["هِ",5]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["رَّبِّ","(the) Lord","rabbi",""],["ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","(of) the worlds","l-ʿālamīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَـٰلَمِينَ",174]]]]},{"t":"Or do they say, \"He invented it\"? Rather, it is the truth from your Lord, [O Muḥammad], that you may warn a people to whom no warner has come before you [so] perhaps they will be guided.","w":[["أَمْ","Or","am",""],["يَقُولُونَ","(do) they say","yaqūlūna","",[["يَقُولُ",16],["ونَ",3]]],["ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ","He invented it","if'tarāhu","ۚ",[["ٱفْتَرَىٰ",243],["هُ",5]]],["بَلْ","Nay","bal",""],["هُوَ","it","huwa",""],["ٱلْحَقُّ","(is) the truth","l-ḥaqu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["حَقُّ",64]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["رَّبِّكَ","your Lord","rabbika","",[["رَّبِّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["لِتُنذِرَ","that you may warn","litundhira","",[["لِ",8],["تُنذِرَ",272]]],["قَوْمًۭا","a people","qawman",""],["مَّآ","not","mā",""],["أَتَىٰهُم","has come to them","atāhum","",[["أَتَىٰ",62],["هُم",3]]],["مِّن","any","min",""],["نَّذِيرٍۢ","warner","nadhīrin",""],["مِّن","before you","min",""],["قَبْلِكَ","before you","qablika","",[["قَبْلِ",65],["كَ",18]]],["لَعَلَّهُمْ","so that they may","laʿallahum","",[["لَعَلَّ",109],["هُمْ",3]]],["يَهْتَدُونَ","be guided","yahtadūna","",[["يَهْتَدُ",301],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"It is Allāh who created the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them in six days; then He established Himself above the Throne. You have not besides Him any protector or any intercessor; so will you not be reminded?","w":[["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","al-lahu",""],["ٱلَّذِى","(is) the One Who","alladhī",""],["خَلَقَ","cr